<title>FINLAND: Borealis 1996 pretax profit falls - Neste.</title>
<headline>Borealis 1996 pretax profit falls - Neste.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Neste Oy's and Norwegian state-owned Statoil's joint petrochemicals firm Borealis' 1996 pretax profit fell to 870 million Danish crowns from 2.63 billion in 1995, Neste said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Borealis' net sales fell to 15.6 billion crowns from 17.6 billion and the operating profit fell to 790 million crowns from 2.9 billion in 1995, Neste said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
</text>
